      "role": "user",
      "content": "it's just... all those little things, they don't really matter anymore. the tea gets cold, the stone is just a stone. it feels like i'm just performing being alive. it's exhausting, trying to keep up with a body and a life that don't want me anymore. i'm just tired of the struggle to stay.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
